lection Measure (ASM). Step-3: Divide the S into subsets that contains possible values for the best attributes. Step-4: Generate the decision tree node, which contains the best attribute. Step-5: Recursively make new decision trees using the subsets of the dataset created in step -3. Continue this process until a stage is reached where you cannot further classify the nodes and called the final node as a leaf node. DEPARTMENT OF CSE SNGCE 57 Visit https://www.youtube.com/c/sharikatr for my video lectures	\N	f	2026-09-01 21:23:12.626+03	2026-09-01 21:23:11.774408+03	2026-09-01 21:23:11.774408+03
