les (Pages 1–3)", "altText": "A concept map showing agent learning at the center branching into three main reasons for learning from examples: unanticipated situations, changing conditions over time, and unknown programmer solutions.", "editable": true, "diagramType": "concept_map", "fallbackText": "Concept Map: Why Agents Learn from Examples. Root node: Agent Learning. Connected to: 1. Unanticipated Situations (designers cannot predict every scenario, e.g., maze layouts); 2. Changing Conditions (environments shift, e.g., stock market boom and bust); 3. Unknown Solutions (programmers do not know how to code the solution, e.g., facial recognition).", "schemaVersion": "petros.render.v2"}, "version": 0, "whyThis": "The document-led explanation now becomes a visual, editable diagram before any knowledge check. That makes diagram the safest next action.", "delivery": "ai", "sequence": 2, "createdAt": "2026-09-01T18:33:18.537Z", "questions": [], "sessionId": "35b158b4-828f-4535-82f4-94ff91c82fd2", "decisionId": "dbc073b6-b10e-4b40-b3fc-1a911da0463d", "completedAt": null, "correlationId": "7028c9ac-1afd-4df9-936f-9a2b8177344d", "observedOutcome": null, "interactionState": {"diagramExpanded": false, "diagramNodeLabels": {}}}], "status": "active", "detours": [], "version": 1, "maxMoves": 5, "createdAt": "2026-09-01T18:32:54.337Z", "updatedAt": "2026-09-01T18:33:35.047Z", "checkpoints": [{"id": "checkpoint-1", "label": "Find the useful entry", "status": "complete"}, {"id": "checkpoint-2", "label": "Build the idea", "status": "current"}, {"id": "checkpoint-3", "label": "Bring it back", "status": "pending"}, {"id": "checkpoint-4", "label": "Make it yours", "status": "pending"}, {"id": "checkpoint-5", "label": "Close it out", "status": "pending"}], "closeReason": null, "currentGoal": "Build a clear working understanding of Pages 1–3, then check it with one explanation or example.", "sessionType": "learn", "stateVersion": "petros.session-state.v3", "topicProfile": {"cacheKey": "1