 are any places where parts come together and present a possibility for injury. Never use a step ladder as an extension ladder This Photo by Unknown Author is licensed under CC BY-SA Slide 55 Safe use of ladders Ensur", "section": "TUNNELLING", "version": "1:76ab940581b91568", "sourceId": "3d013096-89b2-42cb-b638-88e6f3c75362", "sourceType": "document"}], "pageIndex": 50, "returnHref": "/materials", "referenceId": "3d013096-89b2-42cb-b638-88e6f3c75362", "resumeToken": "d0ccd2fc-e054-48ce-8fca-a0c8917c0b3d", "returnLabel": "Study materials", "registerFactors": ["The student explicitly asked to be taught from their own uploaded pages.", "Keep source grounding visible and separate explanation from quotation."], "emotionalRegister": "curious_grounded", "policyDisclosures": ["Petros uses only extracted pages available to this student and cites their page numbers.", "Document teaching is for explanation and limited quotation; the original file remains the source."], "sourceFingerprint": "8e59b693504a938cff44140a5313b9e67df75df9f90a1a133326871433e99223", "institutionalDecision": {"homework": null, "syllabus": {"decision": "within_bounds", "allowedDepth": 3, "teachingShape": "normal", "requestedTopic": "TUNNELLING", "sourceBoundary": {"approvedSourceIds": [], "externalSourcesAllowed": false}, "studentMessage": "This topic is inside your institution's approved learning scope."}}}, "elapsedSeconds": 219, "fallbackNotice": null, "personalization": {"status": "neutral", "reasons": ["deep depth and deliberate pace are supported by 25 observed actions.", "Confidence is still fragile across 10 checked answers, so an earlier recheck is useful."], "sessionOverride": null}, "expectedMoveType": null, "timeBudgetSeconds": 900, "observationSummary": {"correct": 0, "partial": 0, "answered": 0, "incorrect": 0, "openDetours": 2, "fragileSuccesses": 0, "activeStruggleLevel": 0, "activeWrongAttemptCount": 0, "highValueMisconceptions": 0}, "currentCheckpointId": "checkpoint-2", "institutional