ence": "Pages 52-54"}]}, "version": 1, "whyThis": "The selected document page grounds a direct explanation before Petros asks the learner to answer anything. That makes layered explanation the safest next action.", "delivery": "ai", "sequence": 1, "createdAt": "2026-09-02T08:16:47.575Z", "questions": [], "sessionId": "c7bde594-de31-43c9-aa2b-b230b4e83672", "decisionId": "e87f180c-13db-4fc1-a894-2c9525443b0b", "completedAt": "2026-09-02T08:18:24.632Z", "correlationId": "82814bd7-6d2e-4cd6-804e-9449d372c38e", "observedOutcome": {"stage": 3, "completed": true}, "interactionState": {"noteArtifactId": "19d2e44b-38b0-49c8-a90a-4517957960b1", "requestedAction": "note_saved", "expandedLayerIds": []}}, {"id": "3d57f3fe-479f-44b6-9743-2a4210936696", "status": "current", "content": {"type": "diagram", "edges": [{"to": "node-2", "from": "node-1", "label": "requires planning"}, {"to": "node-3", "from": "node-2", "label": "involves inspecting"}, {"to": "node-4", "from": "node-3", "label": "leads to safe operation"}], "nodes": [{"id": "node-1", "label": "Ladder Safety Overview", "description": "Covers fall prevention, hazard awareness, and proper equipment use from Module 3 (p. 51)."}, {"id": "node-2", "label": "Ladder Setup & Questions", "description": "Determining required reach height, pre-use checks, and appropriate material selection (p. 52)."}, {"id": "node-3", "label": "Ladder Inspection", "description": "Checking for skid-resistant footing, absence of defects, and slip hazards (p. 53)."}, {"id": "node-4", "label": "Safe Use Guidelines", "description": "Full extension of A-frames, locked arms, and avoiding pinch points or step-ladder misuse (p. 54)."}], "title": "Tunnelling & Ladder Safety Concept Map", "altText": "A concept map showing the progression of ladder safety in tunnelling from initial overview through setup, inspection, and safe use guidelines based on Module 3.", "editable": true, "diagramType": "concept_map", "fallbackText": "Ladder safety involves planning set